{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:48:768","content":{"id":768,"title":"Markdown 文件编辑器","content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"基于当前编辑器所见即所得的富文本编辑能力，以及和 Markdown 文件之间的无损转换，支持直接打开已有的 Markdown 文件进行编辑和阅读，编辑体验上对齐 Typora。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_1bf6abb4-101e-47b6-8a08-bfbfd5fe4fa1.webp","uuid":"2c8a8171-7a57-4377-b7a8-77e211d11e7b","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_1bf6abb4-101e-47b6-8a08-bfbfd5fe4fa1.webp","width":720},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"因为编辑的是一个文件，相比于软件内的富文本编辑有一些不同之处："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"图片和链接支持基于相对路径渲染和跳转"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果在设置中资源存储选择的是本地，上传的文件不会放到 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"~/.editor/resources","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 目录下，而是会放到当前所在文件的文件夹下，以便跨设备的同步"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有源码视图和富文本视图"}]}]}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"软件使用文档","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:735","type":"doc","id":735}},{"label":"功能模块","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:745","type":"doc","id":745}},{"label":"高级功能","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:769","type":"doc","id":769}},{"label":"Markdown 文件编辑器","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:768","type":"doc","id":768}}],"prevPage":{"title":"播客生成","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:761","type":"doc","id":761}},"nextPage":{"title":"AI","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:758","type":"doc","id":758}},"createTime":1767260352255,"updateTime":1777730869832,"projectId":48},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1777730869832}}